    {
      "id": "42bb4f5a-35ad-4ffe-b9e3-4f73255002da",
      "title": "Observe a cena, escute a frase e ligue o retrato em espanhol ao sentido em português.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 3,
      "sequenceItem": 2,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "e66a03b3-8ee5-448a-bfd5-9387a0ad8987",
          "textContent": "<p>Primeiro, veja como o perfil aparece quando falamos de um traço habitual.</p><p><strong>Tomás es serio.</strong></p><p>Em português: <strong>Tomás é sério.</strong></p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/7ea697cdcbd5460db2cc7f1756fcfdeb_l02b01-office-profile.png?Expires=1794099548&Signature=SRJg2LI~fEzzEHEuTTeo7rVJEIkr6lEVA2bUAFA3zPdGu3J8ASswMGVwfkL1NAuZOeB5zJ3CjgVQJ2ZIGhwq2unfCBUWTuatWo6buFfHqE1M6eSEhE4zhN3bjTd5PSKKv~syCHsIN1xJPXoEd9ck851DgY3x5sE1YtHSvz0SUZTqfymvOT9j3hIFD2dFwKKau2RPHpsroymUV3kSvfS0fE62Qlbta0ev9o2HpTcrPUygaoPKDjgAk6qfMuskmIK7TVEL-LgoLEWo5QqZ-KY~viD7kMMXmwm9CmYfvok5Y6MFYwgv66y2J1yHANrk33~T1ic70SBZJgGPTuW2iBALBQ__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/202d175cf920426db3b1412c045ae834_l02b01-tomas-es-serio.mp3?Expires=1794099548&Signature=CsQO1FlvD~FVfsDrvLkjp31aM-i~tinDAP-vnPZFADC~n0QMutGlI0S93AZ9NQuPi1SQ1X1Yp8lw7yJsYNffNRcU90k56lp4zbnH4aMyRfDROz08NATSM0NxFzlfG9g~8NWn5KhvrhLCssDYYfMr5AtlXigc~4P~rojZVugoUdBoaDgc-NYk-vt4Cz~M3h-OeNFja-sco5pdmeaCyqkcB8UOJO3nd66qAQaO3b4abM~vqU5xxW68NImx3cZlVzXNnwV5kzEyyd1uG5JOT~Nlmptl~f4sMdd~mD7mZwxSwcvfXknmEsphthxaUQu0i-hbxeLCPRVOx3LaArDLiVhGfQ__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
